#: src/almuten.c:723
msgid "  THE LORD OF THE CHART (ALMUTEN FIGURIS)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:726
msgid ""
"    The Almuten Figuris acts as the supreme ruler of your natal chart,\n"
"    representing the evolutionary helmsman of your soul. While the "
"Ascendant\n"
"    governs the physical vessel, the Almuten dictates the highest spiritual\n"
"    purpose, latent talents, and the path to inner mastery.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:734
msgid ""
"    CO-REGENCY DETECTED: Spiritual Conjunction\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:736
msgid ""
"    Your chart presents a rare cosmic occurrence: a shared throne. Multiple\n"
"    archaic planetary forces balance each other perfectly, demanding that "
"you\n"
"    integrate both streams of consciousness to achieve your destiny.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:748
msgid "ARCHETYPAL RULER"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:751 src/almuten.c:968
msgid "(THE SUN - ☉)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:752 src/almuten.c:969
msgid "(THE MOON - ☽)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:753 src/almuten.c:970
msgid "(MERCURY - ☿)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:754 src/almuten.c:971
msgid "(VENUS - ♀)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:755 src/almuten.c:972
msgid "(MARS - ♂)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:756 src/almuten.c:973
msgid "(JUPITER - ♃)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:757 src/almuten.c:974
msgid "(SATURN - ♄)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:763 src/almuten.c:775 src/almuten.c:786 src/almuten.c:797
#: src/almuten.c:808 src/almuten.c:819 src/almuten.c:834
msgid ""
"    Spiritual Essence:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:764
msgid ""
"    The soul seeks the expression of pure individuality, truth, and "
"integrity.\n"
"    There is an intrinsic calling to become a source of light, clarity, and\n"
"    centrality for yourself and others.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:767 src/almuten.c:778 src/almuten.c:789 src/almuten.c:800
#: src/almuten.c:811 src/almuten.c:822 src/almuten.c:840
msgid ""
"    Character Impact:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:768
msgid ""
"    Confers natural nobility, personal magnetism, generosity, and a sharp\n"
"    sense of destiny or mission. The native leads through dignified "
"actions.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:770 src/almuten.c:781 src/almuten.c:792 src/almuten.c:803
#: src/almuten.c:814 src/almuten.c:827 src/almuten.c:846
msgid ""
"    Evolutionary Hurdles:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:771
msgid ""
"    Avoid the trap of excessive pride, egocentrism, vanity, or a neurotic\n"
"    need for constant external validation and applause.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:776
msgid ""
"    The spiritual path is realized through nurturing, cosmic alignment, and "
"a\n"
"    deep connection to the emotional tides of the world. The soul protects.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:779
msgid ""
"    Grants extreme empathy, razor-sharp intuition, a bond with ancestry,\n"
"    and a rich imagination. Highly adept at reading environmental "
"atmospheres.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:782
msgid ""
"    Mastering unstable mood swings, hypersensitivity, over-attachment to "
"the\n"
"    past, and a natural tendency to slide into passive dependency.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:787
msgid ""
"    Evolution occurs via the intellect, the translation of reality, and the\n"
"    unraveling of the laws that weave and connect all structural data.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:790
msgid ""
"    Brings a brilliant mind, precise adaptability, and an elite talent for\n"
"    the written or spoken word. An eternal learner and master problem "
"solver.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:793
msgid ""
"    Guarding against nervous system exhaustion, oscillating opinions,\n"
"    intellectual duplicity, and a tendency to rationalize true emotions.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:798
msgid ""
"    The soul seeks beauty, balance, absolute justice, love, and the sacred\n"
"    reconciliation of opposites. Growth mirrors through deep relationships.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:801
msgid ""
"    Confers authentic charm, innate diplomacy, refined aesthetic taste, and\n"
"    magnetic attraction. You attract assets, art, and peace with comfort.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:804
msgid ""
"    Evading superficiality, self-indulgence, a chronic fear of "
"confrontation\n"
"    (which breeds false diplomacy), and codependency.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:809
msgid ""
"    The soul refines itself through friction, righteous combat, courage,\n"
"    and severing stagnant attachments. Vital force demands protection of the "
"weak.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:812
msgid ""
"    Grants unyielding determination, executive focus, wild independence, "
"and\n"
"    pioneering drives. The native actively thrives under extreme pressure.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:815
msgid ""
"    Channelling destructive wrath, chronic impatience, verbal aggression,\n"
"    and the base impulse to act tyrannically or purely out of self-"
"interest.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:820
msgid ""
"    The journey is bound to higher consciousness expansion, unwavering "
"faith\n"
"    in natural law, philosophy, and magnifying the spirit of benevolence.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:823
msgid ""
"    Brings infectious optimism, a broad structural worldview, accidental "
"luck,\n"
"    and deep ethical codes. Acts as a natural, comforting counselor.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:829
msgid ""
"    Controlling the slope toward excess (dogmatism, over-spending), naive\n"
"    optimism that miscalculates physical danger, and intellectual "
"arrogance.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:836
msgid ""
"    The soul elected absolute mastery via self-discipline, heavy "
"responsibility,\n"
"    the laws of time, hard boundaries, and wisdom etched directly into "
"stone.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:842
msgid ""
"    Confers exceptional sobriety, titanic resilience, strategic patience, "
"and\n"
"    pragmatism. Built to harvest true success and authority in maturity.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:848
msgid ""
"    Avoiding chronic pessimism, paralyzing melancholy, fear of material "
"failure,\n"
"    mental rigidity, and crushing yourself under unearned guilt.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:855
msgid "  [NARRATIVE END] - Press 'Q' or ESC to return to the Almuten panel.\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:922
msgid " Solar Return Almuten: Lord of the Year "
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:942
msgid "  THE LORD OF THE YEAR (ALMUTEN OF SOLAR RETURN)\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:945
msgid ""
"    Unlike your Natal Almuten, which rules over your entire lifetime and "
"soul blueprint,\n"
"    the Almuten of the Solar Return operates as the temporal manager of your "
"current year.\n"
"    It indicates where the cosmic focus will manifest most intensely, "
"driving events,\n"
"    circumstances, and the psychological tone of these specific 12 months.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:952
msgid ""
"    CO-REGENCY DETECTED: Shared Annual Focus\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:954
msgid ""
"    Two or more planetary archetypes share equal operational strength this "
"year.\n"
"    Your experiences will be double-sided, forcing you to balance both "
"planetary themes\n"
"    simultaneously to navigate the year's challenges effectively.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:966
msgid "ANNUAL OPERATIONAL RULER"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:980 src/almuten.c:997 src/almuten.c:1008 src/almuten.c:1019
#: src/almuten.c:1030 src/almuten.c:1041 src/almuten.c:1056
msgid ""
"    The Focus of the Year:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:982
msgid ""
"    This is a year of high visibility, core awakening, and personal "
"sovereignty.\n"
"    Circumstances will push you to step into the center stage of your own "
"life,\n"
"    demanding absolute clarity of purpose and professional recognition.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:986 src/almuten.c:1000 src/almuten.c:1011 src/almuten.c:1022
#: src/almuten.c:1033 src/almuten.c:1044 src/almuten.c:1062
msgid ""
"    Practical Manifestations:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:988
msgid ""
"    Expect opportunities for career promotion, leadership roles, and a surge "
"in\n"
"    vital energy. Important encounters with authoritative figures are highly "
"likely.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:991 src/almuten.c:1003 src/almuten.c:1014 src/almuten.c:1025
#: src/almuten.c:1036 src/almuten.c:1049 src/almuten.c:1068
msgid ""
"    Annual Warnings:\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:993
msgid ""
"    Guard heavily against egotism, prideful power struggles, and burning out "
"due to\n"
"    a neurotic need for constant public approval and validation.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:998
msgid ""
"    A highly personal, internal, and emotional 12-month chapter. The focus "
"shifts\n"
"    entirely toward foundations, family, domestic stability, and inner "
"security.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1001
msgid ""
"    Strong indicators of real estate adjustments, changes in the household "
"or family\n"
"    dynamics, and events that will test and restructure your emotional "
"resilience.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1004
msgid ""
"    Beware of volatile mood swings, hypersensitivity to external criticism, "
"and the\n"
"    tendency to retreat into defensive, nostalgic isolation when friction "
"arises.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1009
msgid ""
"    A year driven by intense mental activity, intellectual output, and "
"networking.\n"
"    Your analytical skills and communication channels will be highly "
"accelerated.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1012
msgid ""
"    Excellent periods for signing contracts, negotiating business deals, "
"academic\n"
"    pursuits, writing, and multiple short-distance travels or structural "
"moves.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1015
msgid ""
"    High risk of nervous system exhaustion, acute mental anxiety, split "
"focus, and\n"
"    the danger of over-rationalizing critical decisions that require "
"emotional depth.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1020
msgid ""
"    A year designated for harmonic consolidation, financial focus, and "
"relationship\n"
"    evaluations. The core theme is finding value, alignment, and social "
"peace.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1023
msgid ""
"    Favorable timelines for artistic endeavors, income enhancement, entering "
"strategic\n"
"    alliances, and experiencing a profound growth in your active romantic "
"life.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1026
msgid ""
"    Watch out for financial extravagance, lazy self-indulgence, and avoiding "
"necessary\n"
"    confrontations out of a codependent desire to keep up superficial "
"appearances.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1031
msgid ""
"    A dynamic, highly friction-based, and action-heavy period. This year "
"demands\n"
"    intense physical courage, independent initiatives, and cutting away dead "
"weight.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1034
msgid ""
"    Overcoming major obstacles through raw effort, launch of independent "
"enterprises,\n"
"    but also a strong indicator of physical expenditures and competitive "
"standoffs.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1037
msgid ""
"    Prone to acute accidents due to rash haste, explosive outbursts of "
"anger,\n"
"    unnecessary litigations, and burnouts caused by operating in perpetual "
"survival mode.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1042
msgid ""
"    The year of expansion, philosophical growth, and providential "
"opportunities.\n"
"    A benevolent energy wraps around your efforts, granting a protective "
"buffer.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1045
msgid ""
"    Financial expansion, legal resolutions rolling in your favor, publishing "
"success,\n"
"    and meaningful long-distance journeys that broaden your entire "
"existential worldview.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1051
msgid ""
"    Severe risk of over-expansion and arrogance. Blind, naive optimism that "
"ignores\n"
"    material safety nets, leading to over-leveraging and ideological "
"dogmatism.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1058
msgid ""
"    A sobering year of evaluation, heavy duty, consolidation, and setting "
"limits.\n"
"    Time demands that you build structure and account for real-world "
"responsibilities.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1064
msgid ""
"    Hard, grinding work that yields long-term security, settling deep debts, "
"dealing\n"
"    with administrative inheritances, and professional solidifications under "
"pressure.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1070
msgid ""
"    Prone to chronic fatigue, paralyzing fear of failure, bouts of deep "
"melancholy,\n"
"    and feeling crushed under structural delays or burdens that are not "
"yours to carry.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/almuten.c:1077
msgid ""
"  [NARRATIVE END] - Press 'Q' or ESC to return to the Solar Return panel.\n"
msgstr ""

